\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨3,-1,2⟩ & =11 \\\\ 3x-y+2z & =11 \\\\ 3x-y+2z-11 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300148 #edb/ref 1080 "-3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300148 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300148 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "27084236-e409-5976-ba9d-d171f96debd1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300384 #edb/ref 1080 "-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300384 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300384 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "50e8d53b-177d-5796-8cf7-52c015fc02a7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300681 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300681 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186300681 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8de30fa2-0c67-5646-bab5-d1acac95ffaf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301284 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186300384 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301284 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301284 #edb/ref 1077 "field-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301284 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186300384 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301284 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "11b7d2ed-536b-5849-8e7d-54f3dbfbb735" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301372 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186300681 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301372 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301372 #edb/ref 1077 "field-3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301372 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186300681 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301372 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "2eae7c05-5e89-5f2f-b6dd-83424a9cf5ce" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301567 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186300148 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301567 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301567 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301567 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186300148 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301567 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "6d7b439f-d927-5a9b-940c-4e51f8e79127" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301284 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301372 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301567 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1069 "q-326901" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1071 "Given the Cartesian equation $2x-y+2z+6=0$ of the plane $Π$, find an equation of $Π$ in the form $(r-p)\\cdot n=0.$\n\n$(r-⟨0,0,$ \n{{field-1}}\n$⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,$\n{{field-2}}\n, \n{{field-3}}\n$⟩=0$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b8f8613f-ede8-5b23-9e9a-6a90b747b545" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302310 #edb/ref 1074 "First, from the equation of the plane we get that the normal vector of $Π$ is $n=⟨2,-1,2⟩.$\n\nNow, we solve the Cartesian equation of $Π$ for $z$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-y+2z+6 & =0 \\\\ z & =-x+\\frac{y}{2}-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we put $x=0$ and $y=0$, we get $z=-3.$ Hence, the point $P(0,0,-3)$ lies on $Π.$ Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨0,0,-3⟩.$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ (r-⟨0,0,-3⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,-1,2⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312064 #edb/ref 1080 "5x-2y+z=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312064 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312064 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0bf34d07-cd99-5983-8a1b-cb31892f721e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312656 #edb/ref 1080 "x-5y+5z-16=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312656 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186312656 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "543cf762-98f0-583c-b80f-a17527258a20" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313021 #edb/ref 1080 "x-5y+5z=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313021 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313021 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "81d82da8-094c-5d53-92cb-5fda4924d683" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313053 #edb/ref 1080 "5x-2y+z+16=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313053 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313053 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "869b5aba-db3e-5905-b9d5-c7f7146ea7fe" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313609 #edb/ref 1080 "x+5y+5z+16=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313609 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186313609 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d14dfaa9-4c8e-55a3-b867-d30669e90de0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186312064 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186312656 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186313021 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186313053 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186313609 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186312656 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186314404 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "9200a78c-c2dd-5fc5-8cd7-e5930b0a22e4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336168 #edb/ref 1080 "-2x+y+z-2=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336168 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186336168 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0e82b227-9a56-5114-8d60-f1db519ee0d8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337324 #edb/ref 1080 "2x+3y-z-14=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337324 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337324 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8f404ec9-8911-54fa-8613-a6198b2c338f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337560 #edb/ref 1080 "3x+2y-2z-2=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337560 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337560 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a94ce30c-4842-5698-bc28-64b32c7460e1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337676 #edb/ref 1080 "2x-z-14=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337676 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337676 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b98b2fc3-d714-56e3-8598-185596415529" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337689 #edb/ref 1080 "3x+2y-2z-14=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337689 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186337689 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bad68854-37a9-54dc-a14b-ae58354b47a9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186336168 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186337324 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186337560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186337676 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186337689 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186337689 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338343 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "23126fc2-1b82-57e0-8166-f43f5a36d945" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338826 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186338343 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338826 #edb/ref 1069 "q-70809" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338826 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338826 #edb/ref 1071 "Find a Cartesian equation of the plane that passes through the point $P(2,3,-1)$ and is perpendicular to the line \n$r=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338826 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "743ee1e7-8110-5025-8c98-4fb7a2685168" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186338826 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨2,3,-1⟩.$ From the vectorial equation, we find that the line is parallel to the vector $⟨3,2,-2⟩.$ So, the normal vector of the plane is \n\n$$\nn=⟨3,2,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nUsing the dot product, we can find the equation of the plane as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ & =⟨2,3,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute $r=⟨x,y,z⟩$ into the equation above. Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨3,2,-2⟩ & =14 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z & =14 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z-14 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393015 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186393016 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393015 #edb/ref 1069 "q-70818" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393015 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393015 #edb/ref 1071 "Given the Cartesian equation $2x+y-2z-4=0$ of the plane $Π$, find an equation of $Π$ in the form $(r-p)\\cdot n=0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393015 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "73c1d5d9-6a23-5438-8d9f-6779511254e9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393015 #edb/ref 1074 "First, from the equation of the plane we get that the normal vector of $Π$ is $n=⟨2,1,-2⟩.$\n\nNow, we solve the Cartesian equation of $Π$ for $z$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+y-2z-4 & =0 \\\\ -2z & =-2x-y+4 \\\\ z & =x+\\frac{1}{2}y-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we put, say, $x=0$ and $y=0$, we get $z=-2.$ Hence, the point $P(0,0,-2)$ lies on $Π.$ Note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=⟨0,0,-2⟩.$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ (r-⟨0,0,-2⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,1,-2⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393017 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393018 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393019 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393020 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393021 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186393020 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393016 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "ca2ac9ba-0e12-54e9-981f-caf50c21ada3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393017 #edb/ref 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,2⟩)\\cdot ⟨1,0,-1⟩=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393017 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393017 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d75490e5-1509-58bb-9763-c438183b853c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393018 #edb/ref 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,-2⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,0,-2⟩=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393018 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393018 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "aeda2ffa-42b4-52c6-88ee-ca624f7cbd32" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393019 #edb/ref 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,2⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,1,-2⟩=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393019 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393019 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e668ab95-81b2-5487-a8db-a7ad8d3973d8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393020 #edb/ref 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,-2⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,1,-2⟩=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393020 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393020 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9538cda3-e06b-5fe5-b129-c566cce61ce5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393021 #edb/ref 1080 "(r-⟨0,0,-2⟩)\\cdot ⟨2,-2,-4⟩=0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393021 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393021 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "937f4290-2d11-5090-a4a2-afbc778336d1" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
